WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- Well I haven't seen you.

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:03.290
I went to go visit
"Superstore" with the teachers.

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:05.870
- That's right, Oh my gosh it was so cute.

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:07.800
We were waiting and we were
in the middle of shooting,

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.207
and so they're like "Oh just
go over to the other stage

00:00:09.207 --> 00:00:10.883
"and wait for Kelly Clarkson
to come and surprise

00:00:10.883 --> 00:00:12.946
"all these music teachers."

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:15.730
But the cameras are on
us, we're all ready to go,

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:16.563
we're waiting.

00:00:16.563 --> 00:00:17.550
And America just turns to me,

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.180
and I had no idea what was going on.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:20.057
And she was like

00:00:20.057 --> 00:00:22.277
"Are we suppose to pretend
we're not losing our minds

00:00:22.277 --> 00:00:24.360
"that we're about to meet Kelly Clarkson?"

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.404
- Are you serious?

00:00:25.404 --> 00:00:27.970
- (Lauren) Yeah. She played
it off so well right?

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:28.828
- Oh my God, she played it off so well

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:31.760
I wouldn't of even known she knew a song.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.018
- Oh no, she's obsessed.

00:00:33.018 --> 00:00:33.851
- What!

00:00:33.851 --> 00:00:35.140
- Oh yeah, yeah, like legit.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.417
And literally you'd
come in and she was like

00:00:36.417 --> 00:00:37.699
"Hi" (mumbles) or whatever.

00:00:37.699 --> 00:00:38.957
And then she turned to me and
be like (silently mouths).

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.741
- Oh my God, she kept her cool so well.

00:00:42.741 --> 00:00:44.787
- Towards the end you
said something about like

00:00:44.787 --> 00:00:47.240
"You guys should all come visit
us on the show some time."

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:48.947
and she literally, I don't
think you heard her, she went

00:00:48.947 --> 00:00:50.457
"Yeah and you'll be friends."

00:00:50.457 --> 00:00:53.110
(laughing and applause)

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:55.340
Oh my God, it was so cute, legit.

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:56.840
- Have you ever,

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:58.270
that just blows my mind I didn't know,

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:00.830
have you ever just lost
it when you met someone?

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:01.663
And you were like,

00:01:01.663 --> 00:01:03.130
"Wait that was not a cool moment."

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:04.060
- Oh yes.

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:05.433
- Me too.
- So many times.

00:01:05.433 --> 00:01:07.239
I think the most memorable would be,

00:01:07.239 --> 00:01:10.210
this was my first movie
role I ever booked,

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:12.389
it was in a film called
"Lars and the Real Girl"

00:01:12.389 --> 00:01:15.690
starring Canada's
sweetheart, Ryan Gosling.

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:16.810
- Oh that's how I know,

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:18.240
I was like "I know that movie."

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:19.073
- So, I'm Canadian

00:01:19.073 --> 00:01:21.220
and I was still living
in Canada at the time.

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:23.470
So, it was like day one
of the entire production,

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:25.710
it wasn't just my first day,
'cause I had a smaller part,

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:26.830
it's the first day of everything.

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:28.550
So there's kind of a
buzz around everybody,

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:31.060
'cause I know all the
other smaller part actors,

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:32.257
