00:01:32.257 --> 00:01:34.582
"Oh my gosh, Ryan Gosling,"
like "What's this gonna be?"

00:01:34.582 --> 00:01:37.130
And then he shows up and he
had gained a bunch of weight

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.833
for the role and had grown this mustache.

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:42.429
- That's the day the "Notebook" died.

00:01:42.429 --> 00:01:44.900
(laughing)

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:46.160
- Yeah 100%.

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:47.470
And so,

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:48.590
But there's like a hush around us

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:50.640
'cause it's Ryan Gosling
and even with everything

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:52.660
